              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndungi useshamishiro usakeja Pasaka; ela ngera mghenyi ungi mkwanye wakunda kubonya Pasaka kwa BWANA, wandu wake wa womi wose suti wishamisho, niko uchaadima kusoghoda na kubonya Pasaka; nao uchatalwa karakara na muisanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sharia ichakaia imweri kwa muisanga na kwa mghenyi uko aghadi konyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wose wikabonya sa iji koni BWANA orewilaghirieghe Musa na Haruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku jija jeni, BWANA ukaghiwifunya majeshi gha wandu wa Israeli wifume isanga ja Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
